MPSQL v.1.0 - an interactive query tool for Postgres95,
similar to Oracle's Server Manager motif worksheet
and Microsoft's Windows based SQL Server iSQL query
tool has been uploaded to:

ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/Incoming/mpsql-1.0.tar.gz
ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/Incoming/mpsql-1.0-static-linux-bin.tar.gz
ftp://nic.funet.fi/pub/OS/Linux/incoming/mpsql-1.0.tar.gz
ftp://nic.funet.fi/pub/OS/Linux/incoming/mpsql-1.0-static-linux-bin.tar.gz

FEATURES:

* execute multiple SQL statements or one of many by 
  highlighting then executing
* work with multiple buffers
* open/save buffers from/to files
* cut/copy/paste between buffers
* spool query output to a file
* spool data in fixed length, comma, tab or space delimited format
* print buffers
* save application options to a startup file ($HOME/.mpsql)

REQUIREMENTS:

Postgres95 1.0 - libpq
Motif 2.0 - a statically linked binary is available!
libc.so.5+
libdl.so.1.7+
libXxxx.so.6
libXpm.so.4.3


