-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----

NetWatcher is a full-featured network security/administration tool.  It
enables the administrator to have complete control over their network.
Any session traveling through the network can be monitered in real time,
letting the administrator view it exactly as the user would see it.  
It also supports the following features:

Session logging 
With session logging the administrator can record the session of any
user on their network.  And using VCR mode, a recorded session can be 
played back, showing everything exactly as it happened.  1x, 2x, 3x play 
speeds are supported, along with pause, and stop functions.  

Hijack Mode
With hijack mode, the administrator can actually SEIZE CONTROL of another
users session.  Once hijacked, the original user will be locked out, 
leaving the administrator in complete control.  

Session Termination
With session termination, the administrator can instantly close the 
session of a user on their network.  

Dynamic Firewalls
With dynamic firewalls, the administrator can create temporary firewalls
on the fly, and firewall lists can be saved/loaded into data files.

For more information on NetWatcher, please visit the NetWatcher homepage
at:  http://www.tripod.com/~EBT/netwatch.html




