DND is a new public drag and drop protocol that can be used with any X
program. An interface to the Xt lib is provided with the OffiX
distribuition (http://gutenberg.lcmi.ufsc.br/OffiX).

The OffiX distribution comes with four Athena-based programs that are
DND compliant: a file manager, a waste basket, a print manager and a
text editor. Existing Xt programs can become DND compatible by adding a
few lines to the source code. A DVI manual is available too, see the
OffiX distribution.

