dated 03FEB96, to sunsite.unc.edu.  It will be moved to
<URL:ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/docs/LSM.03FEB96> at some later
time.  See the Incoming directory for now.

The LSM is a database of software that is available for Linux.
New entries are sent to the Son of the LSM Robot (a.k.a. Sonny),
at lsm@osf-alpha.cs.helsinki.fi.  Sonny will instruct you, if you send
it mail.

For more information about the LSM, see
<URL:http://www.iki.fi/liw/linux/lsm.html>; this is the official LSM
home page.  There are links there to WWW search engines for the LSM
(I expect the maintainers will update their copies of the database
in the near future).

