I no longer collect new entries from sunsite.unc.edu, nor do I accept
them by mail sent to me (unless Sonny is misbehaving).  I'm sorry, but
it was way too much work, since it meant that I had to manually edit
just about every entry (Sonny won't accept an entry unless it is
syntactically correct).

(This change was announced in the beginning of December the previous time,
two months ago.  Sunsite notes about it when you CD into Incoming.  This 
should be sufficient warning.)


Lars Wirzenius, liw@iki.fi, LSM maintainer.

PS.

