Hi Yall,

 First time to release something so bear with me! 

 Termpkg is a client/server combination for accessing serial ports on 
other machings over a TCP/IP network using the Telnet protocol. The both 
the client can connect to telnet servers and the server can accept 
connections to telnet clients to add to its flexibilty. 

