     1995.

  o  Linux Hebrew HOWTO, by Yair G. Rajwan <yair@hobbes.jct.ac.il>.  How
     to configure Linux for use with the Hebrew characterset. Updated 12
     September 1995.

  o  Linux INFO-SHEET, by Michael K. Johnson <johnsonm@sunsite.unc.edu>.
     Generic introduction to the Linux operating system. Updated 31
     March 1995.

  o  Linux IPX HOWTO, by Terry Dawson <94004531@postoffice.csu.edu.au>.
     How to install and configure IPX networking. Updated 14 January
     1996.

  o  Linux Installation HOWTO, by Matt Welsh <mdw@sunsite.unc.edu>.  How
     to obtain and install the Linux software. Updated 11 December 1994.

  o  Linux Italian HOWTO, by Marco ``Gaio'' Gaiarin <gaio@dei.unipd.it>.
     How to configure Linux for use with the Italian characterset.
     Updated 6 January 1996.

  o  Linux JE HOWTO, by Hiroo Yamagata <hiyori13@interramp.com>.
     Information on JE, a set of Japanese language extensions for Linux.

  o  Linux Java HOWTO, by Eric S. Raymond <esr@snark.thyrsus.com>.  How
     to get started with Java and HotJava. Updated 10 December 1995.

  o  Linux Kernel HOWTO, by Brian Ward <ward@blah.tu-graz.ac.at>.
