Short Description:
- - ------------------
A gathering place for Linux users at the University of Michigan,
Eastern Michigan University, Washtenaw Community College, and the
general public in the Ann Arbor/Ypsilanti area.

There is currently a mailing list for the users group. Send an e-mail
subscription request to Linux.Users.Group-request@umich.edu and any
mail for the group to Linux.Users.Group@umich.edu

Any questions, comments, or suggestions can be mailed to Neil McNeight
(mcneight@umich.edu).

Topic:
- - ------
Optimizing your System

Guest Speaker: Jon Cortmaior

He will be talking about various ways to optimize your Linux system
including:
* Recompiling the X-server for YOUR machine.
* Recompiling and Using Multiple kernels, taliored for your needs.
* Using full optimization instead of just "-O".
* Adjusting various init files to speed things up.
* And more!

